{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2022-10-05 09:00:00', 'title': 'EPIRUS, GENERAL DYNAMICS LAND SYSTEMS UNVEIL INTEGRATED COUNTER-ELECTRONICS SYSTEM STRYKER LEONIDAS', 'text': "IN JUST TEN MONTHS, EPIRUS AND GD TRANSFORMED SYSTEM FROM CONCEPT TO FIELD DEMONSTRATED WITH SUCCESSFUL DENIAL OF MULTIPLE ELECTRONIC TARGETS HIGHLIGHTS: SUCCESSFUL INTEGRATION OF EPIRUS' LEONIDAS HIGH-POWER MICROWAVE (HPM) ARRAY WITH GENERAL DYNAMICS LAND SYSTEMS STRYKER GROUND COMBAT VEHICLE, ONE YEAR AFTER THE COMPANIES INKED A STRATEGIC TEAMING AGREEMENT IN OCTOBER OF 2021. LEONIDAS' SOFTWARE WEAPONEERING AND MODULAR ARCHITECTURE PAIRED WITH THE STRYKER'S TRACK-RECORD OF COMBAT EFFECTIVENESS ENABLE UNPRECEDENTED COUNTER-ELECTRONICS CAPABILITIES FOR THE MANEUVER FORCE."}